+    * ``operations``: List of `operations`. If empty, all `operations` are included. Options:
+        * ``create``
+        * ``update``
+        * ``delete``
+    * ``resources``: List of Kubernetes `resources`. If empty, all `resources` are included. Options:
+        * ``deployment``
+        * ``pod``
+        * ``job``
+        * ``node``
+        * ``replicaset``
+        * ``statefulset``
+        * ``daemonset``
